    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d332-a7">

                <pb facs="0451" n="377" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg377"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Headquarters Military Division of the
                                Gulf</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">New Orleans,
                            La.,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-01-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 15, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Respectfully returned to the Secretary of War with accompanying report of a
                    military commission appointed to investigate this case.</p>
                <p>It appears that the schooner Le Verrier was protected by United States troops and
                    robbed by those of the so-called Confederate States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>P. H. SHERIDAN, <hi rendition="#italic">Major General
                        Commanding.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
